        "type": "tool_result",
        "content": "# bbarit-oss: Open-Source AI Coding Agent\n\n## Project Overview\n\n**bbarit-oss** is an open-source AI coding agent built as a standalone CLI tool, originally extracted from the BBARIT Terminal desktop IDE. Written in Rust, it ships as a single static binary with no runtime dependencies (no Node, no Python), supporting macOS, Linux, and Windows.\n\n## Key Features\n\n- **15+ LLM providers** with 1,000+ models from a unified registry (Anthropic Claude, OpenAI GPT/Codex, Google Gemini, OpenRouter, Groq, Mistral, Together, Fireworks, DeepSeek, Cerebras, Amazon Bedrock, GitHub Copilot, and local models via Ollama)\n- **Privacy-focused**: keys and code stay on your machine; nothing hard-coded or phones home\n- **Built-in semantic code search** using bundled Semble\n- **295 curated personas** across 30 domains for specialized expertise\n- **Auto-memory system** adapted from qwen-code for cross-session persistence\n- **Project wiki** for durable knowledge base about codebase architecture\n- **MCP server/skill interoperability** with Claude Code and Codex configurations\n\n## Installation\n\n**macOS/Linux:**\n```bash\ncurl -fsSL https://bbarit.com/agent/install.sh | sh\n```\n\n**Windows (PowerShell):**\n```bash\nirm https://bbarit.com/agent/install.ps1 | iex\n```\n\n**From source:**\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/bbarit/bbarit-agent-oss\ncd bbarit-agent-oss\ncargo build --release\n```\n\n## Architecture & Heritage\n\nThe project inherits Pi's core philosophy of \"a small, legible agent loop and a tight set of first-class tools\" while adding:\n- Multi-process orchestrator for parallel sub-agents\n- Project wiki and auto-memory systems\n- 295 built-in personas\n- Bundled semantic code search\n\nAccording to the documentation, it is \"a from-scratch Rust rewrite — no Pi source lines (comment overlap 0.1%, prose 0%)\" with only non-copyrightable design and data shared.\n\n## License\n\nMIT-licensed (APSL-2.0 for the Rust rewrite), with full provenance details disclosed in PROVENANCE.md.\n\n**GitHub**: https://github.com/bbarit/bbarit-agent-oss  \n**Website**: https://bbarit.com"
      }
    ]
  },
