        "content": "# DarkPs Agent CLI Project Overview\n\n**Created:** July 22, 2026  \n**Repository:** dark-ps/DarkPs-Agent-CLI  \n**License:** Open Source (described as \"intended for open publication\")\n\n## Core Description\n\nDarkPs Agent is an \"extensible automation framework engineered for project workspaces, developer tooling, model orchestration, MCP integration.\" It represents a local-first AI agent system designed for production-grade automation without requiring core infrastructure modifications for extensions.\n\n## Key Features\n\n**Workspace Intelligence**\n- Automatically interprets project structure\n- Loads tools through self-registration from `interpreter/` directory\n- Supports both cloud-based and local GGUF models\n- Maintains persistent memory across sessions\n\n**Extensibility**\n- \"Introduce a provider module, register the model mapping, and the agent handles the rest\"\n- Tools and services auto-discoverable at startup\n- New capabilities integrate without modifying core agent code\n- MCP server integration through dedicated configuration directory\n\n**Operational Capabilities**\n- File operations (read, write, edit, inspect)\n- Code intelligence and workspace search\n- Web access and content inspection\n- Platform integration (GitHub, Hugging Face)\n- Command execution helpers\n- Local language detection\n\n## Architecture\n\n```\nDarkPs-Agent/\n├── api/          → Service providers\n├── interpreter/  → Developer tools and actions\n├── core/         → Model selection, startup logic\n├── Projects/     → Default working directory\n└── MCP/          → MCP server configuration\n```\n\n## Startup Sequence\n\nThe framework follows a 6-step initialization process:\n1. Renders custom startup signature\n2. Applies identity configuration\n3. Inspects active workspace\n4. Loads registered tools and services\n5. Prompts for model selection\n6. Initializes project directory\n\n## Configuration\n\nKey configuration files include:\n- `identity.md` - Agent personality and behavioral profile\n- `логотип.md` - Startup signature customization\n- `model.py` - Centralized model management\n- `Projects/USER_MESSAGE` - Primary user-facing directives\n\nRun with: `python3 main.py`"
      }
    ]
  },
